OfferTransfer_Exits_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the buyer or token is zero
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the offer has zero shares
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAmount
├── when the offer has zero price
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAmount
├── when the offer has no document hash
│   └── it should revert with ZeroDocumentHash
└── when the seller offers a sale
    ├── it should record the offer with the caller as the seller
    ├── it should not move shares or money
    ├── it should not count as the seller's consent
    ├── it should return the transfer id
    └── it should emit TransferOffered
